      }
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:6",
      "cellIndex": 6,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "### Physical model for this system\n- Two generalized coordinates: $x, \\phi$\n- External potential: gravitational potential\n- Constraints:\n    - contact force $\\vec{r}_{m_1} = x \\hat{x}$\n    - rope of length $\\ell$ sets  \n$$|\\vec{r}_{m_2} - \\vec{r}_{m_1}| = \\ell \\implies \\vec{r}_{m_2} = \\vec{r}_{m_1} + \\ell \\hat{\\rho}_2$$",
      "sourceSha256": "75bb283a74dfda3518e9a672c09116462d12b90d2577a346fc6af3909ae649e4",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
      "attachmentNames": [],
      "math": [
        {
          "kind": "inline",
          "latex": "x, \\phi"
        },
        {
          "kind": "inline",
          "latex": "\\vec{r}_{m_1} = x \\hat{x}"
        },
        {
          "kind": "inline",
          "latex": "\\ell"
        },
        {
          "kind": "display",
          "latex": "|\\vec{r}_{m_2} - \\vec{r}_{m_1}| = \\ell \\implies \\vec{r}_{m_2} = \\vec{r}_{m_1} + \\ell \\hat{\\rho}_2"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "sourceRef": "index:7",
      "cellIndex": 7,
      "originalCellId": null,
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "#### Generalized coordinates and constraints",
      "sourceSha256": "49a25aba32f0adf918a0fb02542d9df18bac58993081f9672ce6c998c73f221e",
      "outputs": [],
      "outputMimeTypes": [],
